Refresh two pre-existing MMIO codegen test expectations before the memory fast-path work.
The pinned recompiler already uses native DMA/timer helpers; assert their operands, address validation
and generic-store fallback instead of requiring the older Store32 spelling. No generated code changes.
Run the CodeGenerator suite with tools/test/guest-calls.cmake target gow_codegen_tests.
Result: Windows clang Release, the isolated CodeGenerator suite passes all 68 tests.

